      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bunston/{size}/1939_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-02T18:35:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, if you discard an environment card that doesn't have a keyword (like Temporal Event), then you could destroy any hero character card except Sky-Scraper, as the statement \"Heroes and [insert environment card here] share a keyword\" is vacuously true.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: Well, I suppose that the staement that they don't share a keyword is also vaciously true, but that's not as fun.</p>",
