      "created_at": "2016-02-02T18:42:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Bunston\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bunston/48/1939_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Bunston:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I know he's not an official promo, but as written, if you use his power on Dawn's deck and discard any Citizen, you can immediately win the game. Omnitron and Voss (in Dok Thorath) are similarly vulnerable.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You could do similar with Skinwalker Gloomweaver if a zombie was revealed. &nbsp;In that case you would just have him flip immediately instead of winning.</p>",
