      "raw": "[quote=\"Bunston\"]\n\nI know he&#39;s not an official promo, but as written, if you use his power on Dawn&#39;s deck and discard any Citizen, you can immediately win the game. Omnitron and Voss (in Dok Thorath) are similarly vulnerable.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYou could do similar with Skinwalker Gloomweaver if a zombie was revealed. &nbsp;In that case you would just have him flip immediately instead of winning.\n",
