      "raw": "[quote=\"Bunston\"]\n Also, if you discard an environment card that doesn&#39;t have a keyword (like Temporal Event), then you could destroy any hero character card except Sky-Scraper, as the statement &quot;Heroes and [insert environment card here] share a keyword&quot; is vacuously true.&nbsp;  \n[/quote]\nI disagree here. There is no keyword that the two cards share. On the other hand, if the power said &quot;destroy a card that has all the keywords of the revealed card&quot;, THEN it would be vacuously true. \n\n (I think about vacuous conditions all the time in my day job!) \n",
